================================================================================
PROJECT PROPOSAL: BORDER-SHIELD.AI
Customs & Border Anti-Smuggling Intelligence Framework
================================================================================

1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
--------------------
BORDER-SHIELD.AI provides an automated multi-spectral cargo inspection system 
designed for port customs, international border crossings, and logistics hubs. 
By integrating X-Ray scanner imagery, mass-spectrometry logs, and cargo manifest 
databases, Gemini Vision models automatically identify concealed contraband, organic 
density anomalies, narcotics, and weapons concealed inside heavy freight transport.

